+// sources >= 750 permille of all streaming (the absolute floor — the expected
+// ~875 = 4 members × 1750/(4×1750 + 1×1000), deep below the floor even at
+// 750), and — the clean attribution — the SAME seed with the weight zeroed
+// yields a strictly LOWER estate share (~800, the uniform 4/5).
+@(test)
+test_groups_demand_concentrates_on_estate :: proc(t: ^testing.T) {
