+// --- 5.12: aggregation groups (the estates ruling) ---------------------------
+// The derived estate view + the group-bias growth draw (spec-traffic-model
+// Thread 3 — congestion lives at the shared uplink; user ruling 2026-08-17
+// night: "we usually have homes grouped together in say estates, with the
