+// INSIDE the E31 validity envelope: the bias draw runs first, E31 validates
+// the biased candidate, rejection-sampling (which can land outside the group)
+// is unchanged — E31 stays the hard contract, the uplink is never forced
+// (the player wires it). Group tuning is DATA (balance.json `growth_groups`,
+// playtest-tunable, never a code constant): bias_prob_permille (~750 = the
+// ruling's 0.7–0.8 majority clustered), min/max_members (3–8), radius_tiles
+// (5 — MUST exceed GROWTH_MIN_SEP_TILES = 3, the E31 packing floor), and
+// member_weight_permille (the director's group-scoped demand weight, read
+// via group_pick_scale).
